    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_01",
      "hash64": "BA90C0C352E35F15",
      "text": "Hola a todos. ¿Estáis listos para divertiros\\naprendiendo mates?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_02",
      "hash64": "BA90BDC352E359FC",
      "text": "En la clase anterior hablamos de probabilidades;\\nen concreto, de la precisión de los movimientos.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_03",
      "hash64": "BA90BEC352E35BAF",
      "text": "La estadística es una disciplina muy interesante,\\naun dejando al margen los combates...\\c\\nPor ejemplo, ¿sabíais que, en una clase de 40\\nalumnos, hay un 90 % de probabilidades de que\\r\\ndos de ellos compartan el mismo cumpleaños?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 182,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 229,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_04",
      "hash64": "BA90BBC352E35696",
      "text": "Parece mentira, teniendo en cuenta que un año\\ntiene más de 300 días...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_05",
      "hash64": "BA90BCC352E35849",
      "text": "Ay, si es que me ensimismo pensando en estas\\ncosas. Volviendo a lo que nos ocupa hoy...\\c\\nHasta ahora hemos hablado de compatibilidad\\nentre tipos y golpes críticos, entre otros temas.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 184,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_06",
      "hash64": "BA90B9C352E35330",
      "text": "Hemos estado aprendiendo a calcular cómo\\nafectan estos factores al daño de los ataques.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_07",
      "hash64": "BA90BAC352E354E3",
      "text": "Y todos ellos se acumulan para minar los PS del\\nadversario.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_08",
      "hash64": "BA90C7C352E36AFA",
      "text": "Pero hoy os voy a revelar una forma aún más\\nsencilla de potenciar el daño de los ataques.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_09",
      "hash64": "BA90C8C352E36CAD",
      "text": "¡Consiste simplemente en usar movimientos\\ncuyo tipo coincida con el del Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_10",
      "hash64": "BA9445C352E676EB",
      "text": "Si un Pokémon de tipo Roca utiliza Roca Afilada,\\ncuya potencia es de 100, este factor se\\r\\nmultiplicará por 1,5... convirtiéndose en 150.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_11",
      "hash64": "BA9444C352E67538",
      "text": "Si el tipo del Pokémon es distinto, la potencia de\\nRoca Afilada se mantendrá en 100.\\c\\nY no vale usar un Pokémon de un tipo parecido,\\ncomo el tipo Tierra. ¡Tiene que coincidir![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 177,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_12",
      "hash64": "BA9447C352E67A51",
      "text": "El daño de los golpes críticos o los movimientos\\nsupereficaces también se ve afectado por esto,\\r\\nasí que no es ninguna tontería.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_13",
      "hash64": "BA9446C352E6789E",
      "text": "Os voy a plantear un problema para ver si lo\\nestáis entendiendo.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_14",
      "hash64": "BA9449C352E67DB7",
      "text": "Si un Pokémon usa un movimiento de su mismo\\ntipo con potencia 100 contra un oponente débil\\r\\nante ese tipo, ¿cuál será la potencia efectiva?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_07_select_01",
      "hash64": "BECDEE048A9CD2EB",
      "text": "150",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
