      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "A2797D00F12DF956",
      "text": "¡Ay, criatura, casi aciertas! Quizá tenías en mente\\naún ese factor de 1,5 por afinidad de tipo.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "A2797C00F12DF7A3",
      "text": "¡Ay, qué poco te ha faltado! Creo que solo has\\ncontabilizado el factor de vulnerabilidad al tipo\\r\\ny por eso te ha salido 200.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "A2797B00F12DF5F0",
      "text": "¡[VAR 0x0100(0000)], eres una calculadora humana![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_15",
      "hash64": "BA9448C352E67C04",
      "text": "Partiendo de una potencia de 100, primero se\\nmultiplica por 1,5 por coincidir el tipo del\\r\\nPokémon y el del movimiento.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_16",
      "hash64": "BA944BC352E6811D",
      "text": "El 150 resultante se duplica, por ser el oponente\\ndébil contra ese tipo, ¡y asciende a 300![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_17",
      "hash64": "BA944AC352E67F6A",
      "text": "¡El triple de la potencia original! ¿A que parece\\nincreíble?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_18",
      "hash64": "BA943DC352E66953",
      "text": "¡Pues no se acaba ahí! Si el Pokémon adopta su\\nteratipo y este coincide también, la potencia del\\r\\nmovimiento se multiplica no por 1,5, ¡sino por 2![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_19",
      "hash64": "BA943CC352E667A0",
      "text": "Dicho esto, que un Pokémon conozca numerosos\\nmovimientos de varios tipos también resulta muy\\r\\nconveniente para sorprender al rival.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_20",
      "hash64": "BA8A33C352DE03D0",
      "text": "Si lo pensáis, las personas y los Pokémon nos\\nparecemos mucho.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_21",
      "hash64": "BA8A34C352DE0583",
      "text": "Cuanto más fieles nos mantenemos a nosotros\\nmismos, más brillamos con luz propia.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_22",
      "hash64": "BA8A35C352DE0736",
      "text": "¡Espero que este consejo y mis clases os sirvan\\nen el futuro![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_23",
      "hash64": "BA8A36C352DE08E9",
      "text": "A lo mejor esta lección os ha parecido un poco\\nbásica para ser la última, pero es importante.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_24",
      "hash64": "BA8A37C352DE0A9C",
      "text": "Ay, el condenado timbre... Se me ha pasado la\\nclase volando.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_25",
      "hash64": "BA8A38C352DE0C4F",
      "text": "Antes de que os vayáis, quiero deciros que he\\ndisfrutado mucho enseñándoos.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_b_07_math_26",
      "hash64": "BA8A39C352DE0E02",
      "text": "Ya solo nos queda por delante el examen final.\\n¡Aplicaos bien y seguro que os sale genial![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
